  "changes": [
    "Default: historical official model from matching MyoAssist release line; copied official matching meshes, resolved filename case, replaced flat heightfield scene with flat terrain plane; original dynamic parameters and keyframes preserved.",
    "Optional current model: official assist_sim.load_msk export of myolegs22 with official default/contact sanitation; added plane/gravity/1ms implicitfast and portable paths.",
    "Vendored reflex interface imports adapted to direct native_env, removed unused spline imports, isolated mutable instance dictionaries, added explicit model-path option.",
    "No human controller gains trained or changed. External knee torque applied with native qfrc_applied; no prescribed gait or pelvis support.",
    "2026-10-24 coupled-wearable update: backend optionally builds a temporary augmented historical model using explicit fixed thigh/shank inertias and native knee damping. Human source XML and source meshes remain unchanged; photo-inspired appearance uses nonphysical rendering geoms in parent module."
  ],
